                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An Arthouse piece game where it fails to achive any feeling beyond feeling like you saw an old woman died while some European indy artist laments over the dead.\n\n\nThe game seems to be bugged as well, leaving the grandma at the bench, dead, with the birds to only mourn her.\n\nThere is no message here. No lamentations of the past. No loss of everyone gone, but you. No deep meaning.\n\nIt is a artistic failure.",
